        "M_{12} = M_{21} = m_2 \\bigl(l_1 l_{c2} \\cos q_2 + l_{c2}^{2}\\bigr) + I_2",
        "M_{22} = m_2 l_{c2}^{2} + I_2"
      ]
    },
